            "id": 6668118,
            "title": "盤中速報 - 美卡多(MELI-US)大跌5.03%，報1351.57美元",
            "description": "<main class=\"c1tt5pk2\" id=\"article-container\" style=\"--c1tt5pk2-0:20px\"><section style=\"margin-top:30px\"><p>美卡多(<a data-ga-click-item=\"USS:MELI:STOCK:COMMON\" data-ga-event-name=\"Click_Quote\" data-ga-section=\"News_Article_文中行情\" data-ga-target=\"news\" href=\"https://invest.cnyes.com/usstock/detail/MELI\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_self\">MELI-US</a>)截至台北時間20日04:02股價下跌71.54美元，報1351.57美元，跌幅5.03%，成交量651,656（股），盤中最高價1434.73美元、最低價1351.57美元。</p></section><p></p><section style=\"margin-top:30px\"><p><em>美股指數盤中表現</em></p></section><section style=\"margin-top:20px\"><ul><li><a href=\"https://invest.cnyes.com/index/GI/DJI\">道瓊指數</a>：-2.08%</li><li><a href=\"https://invest.cnyes.com/index/GI/INX\">S&amp;P 500</a>指數：-1.89%</li><li><a href=\"https://invest.cnyes.com/index/GI/IXIC\">NASDAQ</a>指數：-2.17%</li><li><a href=\"https://invest.cnyes.com/index/GI/SOX\">費城半導體</a>指數：-2.21%</li></ul></section><section style=\"margin-top:30px\"><p><em>美卡多(<a data-ga-click-item=\"USS:MELI:STOCK:COMMON\" data-ga-event-name=\"Click_Quote\" data-ga-section=\"News_Article_文中行情\" data-ga-target=\"news\" href=\"https://invest.cnyes.com/usstock/detail/MELI\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_self\">MELI-US</a>)歷史漲跌幅</em></p></section><div class=\"i1y9ycug\"></div><section style=\"margin-top:20px\"><ul> <li>近 1 週：-4.97%</li> <li>近 1 月：-21.66%</li> <li>近 3 月：-19.24%</li> <li>近 6 月：-9.4%</li> <li>今年以來：-28.67%</li></ul></section></main>",
